  Data Sources
  ============

  - Weather data provided by Visual Crossing Weather API
    https://www.visualcrossing.com/
  - Suburb coordinates sourced from Wikipedia articles for each respective Maribyrnong City Council suburb
  - Flood risk zone boundaries based on Maribyrnong City Council area geographic data
  - Historical weather patterns for flood risk assessment

